cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Lesion Vision
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite the associated publication
  (Automated histomorphometry of ablative fractional laser lesions enables
  a complete-field census of geometric heterogeneity) once available, and
  this repository.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Quadri
    given-names: Sarfaraz A.
  - family-names: Marks
    given-names: Haley L.
  - family-names: Wang-Evers
    given-names: Michael
