repository-code: 'https://github.com/mgh-mansteinlab/lesion-vision'
license: MIT
keywords:
  - ablative fractional laser
  - histomorphometry
  - semantic segmentation
  - NBTC
abstract: >-
  Deep learning pipeline for four-class segmentation and complete-field
  morphometry of ablative fractional laser lesions in NBTC-stained
  horizontal whole-slide images.
